msgid "Partial Payments"
msgstr "Teilzahlungen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:75
msgid "Product-level deposit rules"
msgstr "Anzahlungsregeln auf Produktebene"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:77
msgid ""
"Use these fields to override the store-wide deposit configuration for this "
"specific product."
msgstr ""
"Verwende diese Felder, um die globale Anzahlungs-Konfiguration fur dieses "
"konkrete Produkt zu uberschreiben."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:89
msgid "Deposit behavior"
msgstr "Anzahlungsverhalten"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:92
msgid "Inherit store setting"
msgstr "Shop-Einstellung ubernehmen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:93
msgid "Enable for this product"
msgstr "Fur dieses Produkt aktivieren"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:94
msgid "Disable for this product"
msgstr "Fur dieses Produkt deaktivieren"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:96
msgid ""
"Choose whether this product should use the global deposit availability or "
"override it."
msgstr ""
"Wahle, ob dieses Produkt die globale Anzahlungsverfugbarkeit verwenden oder "
"uberschreiben soll."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:104
msgid "Deposit type override"
msgstr "Uberschreibung der Anzahlungsart"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:107
msgid "Inherit global type"
msgstr "Globalen Typ ubernehmen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:108
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:148
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Prozentsatz"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:109
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:149
msgid "Fixed amount"
msgstr "Fester Betrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:111
msgid ""
"Leave this on inherit unless the product needs a different deposit type."
msgstr ""
"Lass dies auf ubernehmen, sofern das Produkt keine andere Anzahlungsart "
"benotigt."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:119
msgid "Deposit amount override"
msgstr "Uberschreibung des Anzahlungsbetrags"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:126
msgid ""
"Leave empty to use the global amount. Percentages are stored as plain "
"numbers, for example 30 means 30%."
msgstr ""
"Leer lassen, um den globalen Betrag zu verwenden. Prozentsatze werden als "
"einfache Zahlen gespeichert, zum Beispiel bedeutet 30 gleich 30%."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:134
msgid "Default selection override"
msgstr "Uberschreibung der Standardauswahl"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:137
msgid "Inherit global selection"
msgstr "Globale Auswahl ubernehmen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:138
msgid "Preselect deposit"
msgstr "Anzahlung vorauswahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:139
msgid "Preselect full payment"
msgstr "Vollzahlung vorauswahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:141
msgid ""
"Controls what the customer will see as the default choice when both payment "
"options are available."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, welche Auswahl dem Kunden standardmassig angezeigt wird, wenn "
"beide Zahlungsoptionen verfugbar sind."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:192
msgid ""
"Store-wide deposits are currently disabled, but this product will still be "
"able to offer them because of its override."
msgstr ""
"Globale Anzahlungen sind derzeit deaktiviert, aber dieses Produkt kann sie "
"dank seiner Uberschreibung weiterhin anbieten."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:196
msgid ""
"Store-wide deposits are enabled, but this product will not offer them "
"because of its override."
msgstr ""
"Globale Anzahlungen sind aktiviert, aber dieses Produkt wird sie wegen "
"seiner Uberschreibung nicht anbieten."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:200
msgid ""
"Store-wide deposits are currently disabled. Leaving this product on inherit "
"will keep deposits unavailable here too."
msgstr ""
"Globale Anzahlungen sind derzeit deaktiviert. Wenn dieses Produkt auf "
"ubernehmen bleibt, sind Anzahlungen auch hier nicht verfugbar."

#. translators: 1: deposit amount label, 2: default selection label.
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:205
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Current effective configuration for this product resolves to %1$s with %2$s "
"preselected."
msgstr ""
"Die aktuell wirksame Konfiguration fur dieses Produkt ergibt %1$s mit %2$s "
"als Vorauswahl."

#. translators: %s: formatted amount.
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:223
#, php-format
msgid "a fixed deposit of %s"
msgstr "eine feste Anzahlung von %s"

#. translators: %s: deposit percentage.
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:230
#, php-format
msgid "a %s%% deposit"
msgstr "eine Anzahlung von %s%%"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:242
msgid "full payment"
msgstr "Vollzahlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/ProductDataPanel.php:245
msgid "deposit payment"
msgstr "Anzahlungszahlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:58
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:180
msgid "Pay deposit"
msgstr "Anzahlung bezahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:59
msgid "Pay full amount"
msgstr "Gesamtbetrag bezahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:60
msgid "Deposit"
msgstr "Anzahlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:61
msgid "To pay"
msgstr "Zu zahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:62
msgid "Future payments"
msgstr "Zukunftige Zahlungen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:63
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:157
msgid "Deposit amount"
msgstr "Anzahlungsbetrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:107
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:476
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "Allgemeine Einstellungen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:114
msgid "Enable deposits"
msgstr "Anzahlungen aktivieren"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:121
msgid "Allow store-wide deposit features."
msgstr "Anzahlungsfunktionen im gesamten Shop zulassen."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:127
msgid "Require login"
msgstr "Anmeldung erforderlich"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:134
msgid "Restrict deposit purchases to authenticated customers."
msgstr "Anzahlungskaufe auf authentifizierte Kunden beschranken."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:140
msgid "Deposit type"
msgstr "Anzahlungsart"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:151
msgid ""
"Defines whether the default deposit is calculated as a percentage or a fixed "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, ob die Standardanzahlung als Prozentsatz oder als fester Betrag "
"berechnet wird."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:166
msgid "Default global amount used when no product-level rule is present."
msgstr ""
"Standardmaessiger globaler Betrag, der verwendet wird, wenn keine Regel auf "
"Produktebene vorhanden ist."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:172
msgid "Default selection"
msgstr "Standardauswahl"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:181
msgid "Pay in full"
msgstr "Vollstandig bezahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:188
msgid "Order fully paid status"
msgstr "Bestellstatus fur vollstandig bezahlt"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:201
msgid "Disabled payment gateways"
msgstr "Deaktivierte Zahlungsgateways"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:209
msgid "Gateways selected here will be excluded when a deposit flow is active."
msgstr ""
"Die hier ausgewahlten Gateways werden ausgeschlossen, wenn ein "
"Anzahlungsablauf aktiv ist."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:215
msgid "Minimum eligible amount"
msgstr "Minimaler berechtigter Betrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:224
msgid ""
"Set a minimum product or cart products total required before deposits become "
"available. Use 0 to disable this threshold."
msgstr ""
"Lege einen Mindestbetrag fur das Produkt oder die Produktsumme im Warenkorb "
"fest, bevor Anzahlungen verfugbar werden. Verwende 0, um diese Schwelle zu "
"deaktivieren."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:230
msgid "Balance due in days"
msgstr "Falligkeit des Restbetrags in Tagen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:239
msgid ""
"Defines how many days the customer has to pay the remaining balance after "
"the deposit order is paid."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, wie viele Tage der Kunde Zeit hat, den Restbetrag zu bezahlen, "
"nachdem die Anzahlungsbestellung bezahlt wurde."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:245
msgid "Send balance reminders"
msgstr "Erinnerungen fur Restbetrag senden"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:252
msgid "Send an automatic reminder email before the balance due date."
msgstr ""
"Vor dem Falligkeitsdatum des Restbetrags automatisch eine Erinnerungs-E-Mail "
"senden."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:258
msgid "Reminder lead time"
msgstr "Vorlauf fur Erinnerung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:267
msgid ""
"Number of days before the due date when the reminder email should be sent. "
"Use 0 to remind on the due date itself."
msgstr ""
"Anzahl der Tage vor dem Falligkeitsdatum, an denen die Erinnerungs-E-Mail "
"gesendet werden soll. Verwende 0, um am Falligkeitstag selbst zu erinnern."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:273
msgid "Tax handling"
msgstr "Steuerbehandlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:281
msgid "Charge taxes proportionally with the deposit"
msgstr "Steuern anteilig mit der Anzahlung berechnen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:283
msgid ""
"This release keeps product taxes proportional to the portion paid today and "
"tracks the remaining tax balance separately."
msgstr ""
"Diese Version halt Produktsteuern proportional zum heute gezahlten Anteil "
"und verfolgt die verbleibende Steuer separat."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:289
msgid "Shipping handling"
msgstr "Versandbehandlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:297
msgid "Charge full shipping with the initial payment"
msgstr "Vollen Versand mit der ersten Zahlung berechnen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:298
msgid "Split shipping proportionally with the deposit"
msgstr "Versand anteilig mit der Anzahlung aufteilen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:300
msgid ""
"Use proportional shipping when you want the customer to pay only part of the "
"shipping amount today and defer the rest with the balance."
msgstr ""
"Verwende anteiligen Versand, wenn der Kunde heute nur einen Teil des "
"Versands zahlen und den Rest zusammen mit dem Restbetrag begleichen soll."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:306
msgid "Coupon handling"
msgstr "Gutscheinbehandlung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:314
msgid "Allow coupons on the initial payment only"
msgstr "Gutscheine nur fur die erste Zahlung zulassen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:315
msgid "Exclude deposit items from coupons"
msgstr "Artikel mit Anzahlung von Gutscheinen ausschliessen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:317
msgid ""
"The default policy lets WooCommerce discounts affect the amount paid today, "
"while the remaining balance keeps its own tracked amount."
msgstr ""
"Die Standardrichtlinie erlaubt es WooCommerce-Rabatten, den heute bezahlten "
"Betrag zu beeinflussen, wahrend fur den Restbetrag ein eigener Wert "
"nachverfolgt wird."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:323
msgid "Deposit selection"
msgstr "Anzahlungsauswahl"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:330
msgid "Pay deposit text"
msgstr "Text fur Anzahlung bezahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:342
msgid "Pay full amount text"
msgstr "Text fur Gesamtbetrag bezahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:354
msgid "Deposit text"
msgstr "Anzahlungstext"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:366
msgid "Checkout and order"
msgstr "Kasse und Bestellung"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:373
msgid "To pay text"
msgstr "Text fur zu zahlen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:385
msgid "Future payments text"
msgstr "Text fur spatere Zahlungen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:397
msgid "Deposit amount text"
msgstr "Text fur Anzahlungsbetrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:472
msgid ""
"Current milestone adds deposit settings, product overrides, classic checkout "
"calculations, linked balance orders, customer balance emails, reminders, and "
"My Account balance payment actions. Cart and Checkout Blocks integration is "
"planned for a future release."
msgstr ""
"Diese Entwicklungsstufe erganzt Anzahlungs-Einstellungen, Produkt-"
"Uberschreibungen, Berechnungen fur den klassischen Checkout, verknupfte "
"Restzahlungsbestellungen, Kunden-E-Mails zum Restbetrag, Erinnerungen und "
"Restzahlungsaktionen im Kundenkonto. Die Integration fur Cart- und Checkout-"
"Blocks ist fur eine spatere Version geplant."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:474
msgid "Settings tabs"
msgstr "Einstellungsreiter"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:479
msgid "Labels & text"
msgstr "Beschriftungen und Texte"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:492
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Anderungen speichern"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:502
msgid ""
"Start with sensible store-wide defaults. Product, category, cart, "
"installment, and balance collection rules will build on top of these "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Beginne mit sinnvollen globalen Shop-Standards. Regeln fur Produkt, "
"Kategorie, Warenkorb, Raten und Einzug des Restbetrags bauen auf diesen "
"Einstellungen auf."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:509
msgid ""
"Customize the labels customers will see when choosing between a deposit and "
"a full payment."
msgstr ""
"Passe die Beschriftungen an, die Kunden bei der Wahl zwischen Anzahlung und "
"Vollzahlung sehen."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:516
msgid ""
"These strings are used around the order summary and future balance "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"Diese Zeichenfolgen werden im Bestelluberblick und in der zukunftigen "
"Kommunikation zum Restbetrag verwendet."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:574
msgid "No payment gateways are currently available to configure."
msgstr "Derzeit sind keine Zahlungsgateways zur Konfiguration verfugbar."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:687
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Abgeschlossen"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:104
msgid "The selected product could not be prepared for a deposit purchase."
msgstr ""
"Das ausgewahlte Produkt konnte nicht fur einen Kauf mit Anzahlung "
"vorbereitet werden."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:111
msgid "Deposits are not available for this product."
msgstr "Anzahlungen sind fur dieses Produkt nicht verfugbar."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:118
msgid "Deposits are currently disabled for this product."
msgstr "Anzahlungen sind fur dieses Produkt derzeit deaktiviert."

#. translators: %s: formatted threshold amount.
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:126
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Deposits become available only when the product or cart products total "
"reaches %s."
msgstr ""
"Anzahlungen werden erst verfugbar, wenn das Produkt oder die Produktsumme im "
"Warenkorb %s erreicht."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:135
msgid "Please log in before purchasing this product with a deposit."
msgstr "Bitte melde dich an, bevor du dieses Produkt mit Anzahlung kaufst."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:204
msgid "Payment option"
msgstr "Zahlungsoption"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:209
msgid "Due today"
msgstr "Heute fallig"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:214
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:424
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:425
msgid "Remaining product balance"
msgstr "Verbleibender Produktrestbetrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:431
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:432
msgid "Remaining product tax"
msgstr "Verbleibende Produktsteuer"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:439
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:440
msgid "Remaining shipping balance"
msgstr "Verbleibender Versandrestbetrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:447
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:448
msgid "Remaining shipping tax"
msgstr "Verbleibende Versandsteuer"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:454
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:455
msgid "Estimated remaining balance"
msgstr "Geschaetzter Restbetrag"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Cart/DepositCartManager.php:679
